# `build/`, not `/build`: a leading slash anchors to the repo root, so this
# missed app/build — which is where an Android build actually writes. Nothing
# caught it because CI builds in a throwaway checkout and never commits; the
# first real local build was also the first time `git add -A` could sweep
# 1700 build artefacts into a commit.
build/
/captures
